=== taxi Order
entity Ordering.Order
Fields:
  status Ordering.OrderStatus
  customer Ordering.Customer.Id?
  route Ordering.Route
  carClass Ordering.CarClass
  price Ordering.Money
  driverName string?
  driverPlate string?
  placedAt timestamp
  tip Ordering.Money?
Indexes:
  byCustomer(customer, placedAt desc)
  byStatus(status, placedAt desc)
Members:
  rule perKmRate(requestedClass Ordering.CarClass)
  command place(customerId Ordering.Customer.Id, orderRoute Ordering.Route, requestedClass Ordering.CarClass)
  command PaymentCaptured(transactionId string)
  command PaymentDeclined(reason string)
  command LeaveTip(amount Ordering.Money)
  command Edit(orderRoute Ordering.Route, requestedClass Ordering.CarClass)
  command Cancel(reason string)
  command writeMart()
  command markOffered()
  command resumeSearch()
  command confirmDriver(assignedName string, assignedPlate string)
  command failSearch()
  command finishRide()
  event placed(customerId Ordering.Customer.Id, orderRoute Ordering.Route, requestedClass Ordering.CarClass, orderPrice Ordering.Money, at timestamp)
  event offerPending()
  event searchResumed()
  event driverConfirmed(assignedName string, assignedPlate string)
  event searchExhausted()
  event rideFinished()
  event paymentReceived(transactionId string)
  event paymentFailed(reason string)
  event tipped(amount Ordering.Money)
  event edited(orderRoute Ordering.Route, requestedClass Ordering.CarClass, orderPrice Ordering.Money)
  event orderCancelled(reason string, at timestamp)
  notification orderPlaced(orderId Ordering.Order.Id, price Ordering.Money)
  notification driverOnTheWay(orderId Ordering.Order.Id)
  notification noDriversAvailable(orderId Ordering.Order.Id)
  notification receipt(orderId Ordering.Order.Id, amount Ordering.Money)
  notification paymentProblem(orderId Ordering.Order.Id, reason string)
  error orderAlreadyExists()
  error cannotCancel(currentStatus Ordering.OrderStatus)
  error cannotEdit(currentStatus Ordering.OrderStatus)
  error orderNotFound()
  error tipsDisabled()
  error cannotTip(currentStatus Ordering.OrderStatus)
  query MyOrders(pageReq PageRequest)
  query Card(orderId Ordering.Order.Id)
  query List(wanted Ordering.OrderStatus, pageReq PageRequest)
  query Details(orderId Ordering.Order.Id)

=== taxi Order.Cancel
command Ordering.Order.Cancel(reason string) — public
  Cancelling an order by the customer, support or an administrator;
  Dispatch releases the offer and the driver on the orderCancelled event
Access: the actor in field customer, role support, role admin
Checks:
  if status not in [searching, offered, assigned] → errors: cannotCancel(currentStatus: status), exit
Actions in order:
  event orderCancelled: status
  command writeMart
  command Ordering.Customer.orderFinished on customer (unless none)
UI places: Admin.AdminOrders:Order.Cancel, Admin.AdminOrder:Order.Cancel, Taxi.MyOrder:Order.Cancel

=== taxi Trip.DriverFound
command Dispatch.Trip.DriverFound(driverId Dispatch.Driver.Id) — public
  The matching service answers: a driver is found.
  The offer goes to the driver as the last step: if the driver is busy,
  they return the order at once (driverDeclined), and matching the next driver starts.
Access: role matching
Checks:
  if not [id] or stage != searching → exit without changes
Actions in order:
  deletes timer searchTimer
  schedules a timer for expireOffer
  command Dispatch.Trip.Offer.open on new Offer.Id
  event offerSent: candidate, offerTimer, searchTimer, stage
  command Dispatch.Driver.offerTrip on driverId

=== taxi Trip.findDriver
command Dispatch.Trip.findDriver() — private
  Drivers already offered the trip are not matched again
Access: only other commands and timers
Actions in order:
  schedules a timer for searchTimedOut
  external request Dispatch.Matching.findDriver
  event searchStarted: searchTimer
Called from:
  from command Dispatch.Trip.open
  from command Dispatch.Trip.searchTimedOut
  from command Dispatch.Trip.searchAgain

=== taxi Order.placed
event Ordering.Order.placed(customerId Ordering.Customer.Id, orderRoute Ordering.Route, requestedClass Ordering.CarClass, orderPrice Ordering.Money, at timestamp)
Changes fields: customer, route, carClass, price, placedAt, status
Raised by commands: Ordering.Order.place
Reactions: Dispatch: Ordering.Order.on placed

=== taxi Order.Card
query Ordering.Order.Card(orderId Ordering.Order.Id) Ordering.OrderCard — public
  Order card
Access: actor Ordering.Customer
Checks:
  if o is none or o.customer != me → errors: orderNotFound(), exit
Under feature flags:
  if Ordering.tips is on (since 2026-11-07): nothing
UI places: Taxi.MyOrder:Order.Card

=== taxi Order.perKmRate
rule Ordering.Order.perKmRate(requestedClass Ordering.CarClass) decimal
  Rate per kilometer. An extension may override it.
Checks:
  if requestedClass == comfort → result 45
Used in: Ordering.Order.place, Ordering.Order.Edit

=== taxi Order.cannotCancel
error Ordering.Order.cannotCancel(currentStatus Ordering.OrderStatus)
Used in: Ordering.Order.Cancel

=== taxi (acme) Order.placed
event Ordering.Order.placed(customerId Ordering.Customer.Id, orderRoute Ordering.Route, requestedClass Ordering.CarClass, orderPrice Ordering.Money, at timestamp)
Changes fields: customer, route, carClass, price, placedAt, status
Raised by commands: Ordering.Order.place
Reactions: Ordering.Order.on placed, Dispatch: Ordering.Order.on placed

=== taxi Admin
app Admin "Admin"
Enter: Ordering.Staff, admin, support
Language en, platforms web
Screens:
  Ordering.AdminOrders "Orders"
  Dispatch.NewDriver "New driver"
  Ordering.AdminProfile "Profile"
  Ordering.AdminNewOrder "New order"
  Ordering.AdminOrder(orderId Ordering.Order.Id) "Order"
Places:
  Admin.AdminOrders:Order.List — query Ordering.Order.List
  Admin.AdminOrders:Order.Cancel — command Ordering.Order.Cancel
  Admin.NewDriver:Driver.Register — command Dispatch.Driver.Register
  Admin.AdminProfile:Staff.Profile — query Ordering.Staff.Profile
  Admin.AdminProfile:Staff.ChangeEmail — command Ordering.Staff.ChangeEmail
  Admin.AdminNewOrder:Customer.OrderTaxi — command Ordering.Customer.OrderTaxi
  Admin.AdminOrder:Order.Details — query Ordering.Order.Details
  Admin.AdminOrder:Order.Edit — command Ordering.Order.Edit
  Admin.AdminOrder:Order.Cancel — command Ordering.Order.Cancel
Not in the interface:
  command Dispatch.Trip.DriverFound
  command Dispatch.Trip.NoDriverFound
  command Ordering.Order.PaymentCaptured
  command Ordering.Order.PaymentDeclined
  command Ordering.Staff.Hire

=== taxi Admin.AdminOrder
screen Ordering.AdminOrder(orderId Ordering.Order.Id) "Order"
Apps: Admin
Layout:
  Card Ordering.Order.Details — place Admin.Ordering.AdminOrder:Order.Details
    orderId ← screen parameter orderId
    status Tag (default for enum)
    price Fields (default for value)
      automatically: children
    orderRoute Fields (default for value)
      automatically: children
    requestedClass Tag (default for enum)
    placedAt DateTime (default for timestamp)
    driverName Text (default for string)
    Actions
      Edit Ordering.Order.Edit "Edit" if status == searching — place Admin.Ordering.AdminOrder:Order.Edit
        target ← data Order.Details.orderId
        orderRoute ← input, initial value from data Order.Details.orderRoute
        requestedClass ← input, initial value from data Order.Details.requestedClass
        automatically: children
      Confirm Ordering.Order.Cancel "Cancel" if status in [searching, offered, assigned] — place Admin.Ordering.AdminOrder:Order.Cancel
        target ← data Order.Details.orderId
        reason ← input
        automatically: children

=== taxi AdminOrders
screen Ordering.AdminOrders "Orders"
Apps: Admin
Layout:
  Toolbar
    Link Ordering.AdminNewOrder
  Table Ordering.Order.List — place Admin.Ordering.AdminOrders:Order.List
    wanted ← input, the parameter default
    pageReq ← the primitive (paging)
    automatically: Filters
    Columns
      placedAt DateTime (default for timestamp)
      status Tag (default for enum)
      price Fields (default for value)
        automatically: children
    RowActions
      Confirm Ordering.Order.Cancel if status in [searching, offered, assigned] — place Admin.Ordering.AdminOrders:Order.Cancel
        target ← row Order.List.orderId
        reason ← input
        automatically: children
    on open Ordering.AdminOrder
      orderId ← event orderId

=== taxi Taxi.MyOrders
screen Ordering.MyOrders "My orders"
Apps: Taxi
Layout:
  List Ordering.Order.MyOrders — place Taxi.Ordering.MyOrders:Order.MyOrders
    pageReq ← the primitive (paging)
    status Tag (default for enum)
    price Fields (default for value)
      automatically: children
    placedAt DateTime (default for timestamp)
    on open Ordering.MyOrder
      orderId ← event orderId

=== taxi (acme) MyOrder
screen Ordering.MyOrder(orderId Ordering.Order.Id) "Order"
Apps: Taxi
Layout:
  Card Ordering.Order.Card — place Taxi.Ordering.MyOrder:Order.Card
    orderId ← screen parameter orderId
    automatically: children
    Actions
      Confirm Ordering.Order.Cancel if status in [searching, offered, assigned] — place Taxi.Ordering.MyOrder:Order.Cancel
        target ← screen parameter orderId
        reason ← input
        automatically: children
      Edit Ordering.Order.LeaveTip "Tip" if tips and status == paid — place Taxi.Ordering.MyOrder:Order.LeaveTip
        target ← screen parameter orderId
        amount ← input
        automatically: children
      Edit Ordering.Order.SetCostCenter — place Taxi.Ordering.MyOrder:Order.SetCostCenter
        target ← screen parameter orderId
        code ← input
        automatically: children

=== taxi EntityPicker
primitive EntityPicker<R, K id>(search(text string) list<R>, key field<R, K> = auto, label field<R> = auto)
  Choosing entities with autocompletion
Binds: input K | set<K>

=== bank Account.Transfer
command Accounts.Account.Transfer(target Accounts.Account.Id, sum decimal, comment string) — public
  Transfer to another account
Access: the actor in field owner
Checks:
  if sum <= 0 → errors: invalidSum(sum: sum)
  if target == id → errors: sameAccount()
  if not [target] → errors: accountNotFound(accountId: target)
  if frozen → errors: accountFrozen(accountId: id)
  if comment.length > 140 → errors: commentTooLong(max: 140)
  if hasErrors → exit
  if after.balance < -overdraft → errors: insufficientFunds(available: balance + overdraft), exit
Actions in order:
  event withdrawn: balance
  command Accounts.Account.deposit on target
  external request Accounts.Antifraud.score
  notification transferDone
UI places: Bank.AccountCard:Account.Transfer

=== bank Client.Join
command Accounts.Client.Join(clientName string) — public
Access: self
Checks:
  if [id] → errors: alreadyJoined(), exit
Actions in order:
  event joined: fullName
UI places: Bank.Profile:Client.Join

